msgid "Don't think I'm gonna go easy on you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, shall we go in?"
msgstr "Beh, entriamo?"

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr "Diamoci dentro!"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Don't think I'm gonna go easy on you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Well, shall we go in?"
msgstr "Beh, entriamo?"

msgctxt "196"
msgid "...Hold on a second. I just realized I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""
"Ehm... Aspetta un attimo. Mi sono appena reso conto che sono a corto di "
"grana."

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What? Kiryu-san, what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "232"
msgid "I can't believe you, Kiryu-san... I'm going home. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "(I'd better bring enough cash next time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Amazing! Is there anything you can't do, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "I'm not that special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"That was super fun. I hope you'll take me out again. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""
"Mi sono divertita un mondo. Spero che mi porterai fuori di nuovo. "
"<Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Anyway, I better get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Heh, guess I really gave you a run for your money, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "You weren't bad at all."
msgstr ""

